CAM -[#5050C0]> MC : <color:#5050C0>/camera/image_raw</color>  ≥15 FPS\n  sensor_msgs/Image  ·  encoding=bgr8  ·  1280×720\n  frame_id = "camera_optical"
CAM -[#5050C0]> MC : <color:#5050C0>/camera/camera_info</color>  ≥15 FPS\n  sensor_msgs/CameraInfo  ·  distortion_model = plumb_bob\n  D[5]  ·  K[9] intrinsic  ·  P[12] projection\n  loaded from /etc/drone-mc/camera_calibration.yaml

note over CAM, MC #EDE0F8
  GStreamer: nvarguscamerasrc → nvvidconv → BGR8 → appsink
  Static TF: camera_optical → base_link  (published at startup)
  Used by: visual_localisation_node (VO)  ·  perception_down_node (AI inference, renamed from detection_node)
