' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' IFD-006: Gimbal Camera → MC  (RTSP/H.265)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== IFD-006 · Gimbal Camera → MC · RTSP/H.265 · 192.168.10.200:8554 (shared switch, HIF-007) ==

GIMCAM -[#20A070]> MC : <color:#20A070>RTSP/H.265 stream</color>  ·  rtsp://192.168.10.200:8554/stream1\n  1920×1080 @ 30 FPS  →  perception_front_node (rtspsrc)

note over GIMCAM, MC #C8E8D8
  Independent of IFD-004 (downward CSI camera) — different physical link,
  different node (perception_front_node), different package (video_downlink).
  Link silence > 3 s → GIMBAL_LINK_LOST, clears GIMBAL_OK  [FR-084]
  Perception-only — never triggers a flight failsafe.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' IFD-007: MC → GCS Video Downlink  (RTSP/H.265 + metadata)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== IFD-007 · MC → GCS Video Downlink · RTSP/H.265 + metadata · 192.168.10.11:8555 (Stream A) ==

MC -[#107850]> GCS : <color:#107850>Stream A: RTSP/H.265 + metadata</color>  ·  rtsp://192.168.10.11:8555/mc_video\n  time_usec  ·  track_id  ·  class_id  ·  confidence (×10000)  ·  lat,lon (degE7)  ·  alt (mm)\n  served by video_mux_node, re-encoding perception_front_node's frames + tracks/detections

note over MC, GCS #A8D8C0
  Independent of IFD-002 (MAVLink GCS channel) — separate RTSP server,
  separate port. A stalled video downlink never affects telemetry/command
  traffic.  MC publishes /mc/video/downlink_status (≥1 Hz)  [IR-041, IR-042]
end note

== IFD-007 · MC → GCS Video Downlink · RTSP/H.265 + metadata · 192.168.10.11:8556 (Stream B, downward — additive, 2026-07-22) ==

MC -[#5050C0]> GCS : <color:#5050C0>Stream B: RTSP/H.265 + metadata</color>  ·  rtsp://192.168.10.11:8556/mc_video_down\n  time_usec  ·  class_id  ·  confidence (×10000)  ·  lat,lon (degE7)  ·  alt (mm)  (no track_id)\n  served by video_mux_node (same node, second pipeline), re-encoding camera_node's frames + perception_down_node's detections

note over MC, GCS #D0B8F8
  Additive to Stream A, independent failure domain — silence on one
  stream never affects the other  [FR-085, FR-086, IR-043]. No track_id:
  perception_down_node has no tracker (unlike perception_front_node).
  perception_down_node's existing detection/geolocation role (IFD-004) is
  unchanged — this is a new consumer of its already-published
  /mc/detections, not a replacement.
  MC publishes /mc/video/down_downlink_status (≥1 Hz), independent of
  Stream A's /mc/video/downlink_status.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' IFD-008: MC ↔ Mission Orchestrator  (MAVLink 2/UDP + MAVFTP)
' GCS-004 — MC side done 2026-08-05; the Orchestrator App itself is
' another team's deliverable and has not been built yet.
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== IFD-008 · MC ↔ Mission Orchestrator · MAVLink 2/UDP + MAVFTP · recv :14572  send :14571 ==

ORCH -[#4060C0]> MC : <color:#4060C0>MAVFTP: CreateFile/OpenFileWO + WriteFile + TerminateSession</color>\n  create/update "<name>.json" under /var/drone-mc/mission_plans/\n  Nak(FileExists) on create if present · Nak(FileNotFound) on update if absent
ORCH -[#4060C0]> MC : <color:#4060C0>MAVFTP: ListDirectory("/")</color>\n  one entry per stored plan · "/_active" (synthetic, read-only) reports the active filename
ORCH -[#4060C0]> MC : <color:#4060C0>MAVFTP: OpenFileRO + ReadFile/BurstReadFile</color>\n  read a stored plan · Nak(FileNotFound) if missing
ORCH -[#4060C0]> MC : <color:#4060C0>MAVFTP: RemoveFile("/<name>.json")</color>\n  Nak(FileProtected) if <name>.json is the active plan
ORCH -[#4060C0]> MC : <color:#4060C0>MC_MISSION_PLAN_ACTIVATE (50104)</color>  event\n  client_request_id  ·  filename[64]

MC -[#4060C0]> ORCH : <color:#4060C0>MC_MISSION_PLAN_ACK (50105)</color>  event\n  client_request_id  ·  filename[64]  ·  result (0=ACCEPTED · 1=REJECTED_INVALID_JSON · 2=REJECTED_NOT_FOUND · 3=REJECTED_PHASE)  ·  error_message[50]

note over MC, ORCH #E0E8F8
  Channel C — isolated from Channel B (own mavlink-router process/config,
  ports 14571/14572, loopback :14580).  MC side done — GCS-004.
  activate() converts the named plan's JSON to mc_msgs/MissionUpload and
  publishes /mc/gcs/mission_upload — same topic gcs_mavlink_node (IFD-002)
  already produces; mission_manager_node needs zero changes.
  Plans persisted as one JSON file per plan; unrelated to
  mission_manager_node's existing YAML mission persistence.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' IFD-005: Internal ROS 2 Topics (summary)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== IFD-005 · Internal Topics · CycloneDDS · Domain 0  (MC-internal only) ==

note over FCC, CAM #E8E8F8
  <b>Key /mc/* topics and flows</b>

  fcc_bridge_node  →  /mc/fcc/vehicle_state (≥10 Hz)  →  mission_manager · formation_controller · gcs_mavlink · health_monitor
  fcc_bridge_node  →  /mc/fault (event, FaultEvent — FCC_LINK_LOST)  →  mission_manager_node
  fcc_bridge_node  →  /mc/fcc/mission_ack (event, FCC-006)  →  mission_manager · formation_controller
  formation_controller  →  /mc/fcc/mission_item_update (≥5 Hz)  →  fcc_bridge_node (→ FCC mission, seq 0)
  formation_controller  →  /mc/fcc/offboard_setpoint (≥5 Hz, FCC-009)  →  fcc_bridge_node (→ FCC OFFBOARD stream, OFFBOARD-flagged legs only)
  mission_manager  →  /mc/fcc/mission_upload (on change)  →  fcc_bridge_node (→ FCC mission, full replace)
  mission_manager  →  /mc/fcc/send_command (event)  →  fcc_bridge_node (→ FCC vehicle_command, incl. OFFBOARD mode entry/exit)
  NOT YET IMPLEMENTED (SDD §3.4 item 4, tracked separately — no publisher
  exists in fcc_bridge_node today): /mc/fcc/imu, /mc/fcc/odometry relays

  gcs_mavlink_node  →  /mc/gcs/command (event)        →  mission_manager_node
  gcs_mavlink_node  →  /mc/gcs/mission_upload (event) →  mission_manager · swarm_coordinator
  mission_orchestrator_node (IFD-008, GCS-004) → /mc/gcs/mission_upload (on activate) → mission_manager · swarm_coordinator
  gcs_mavlink_node  →  /mc/gcs/link_status (1 Hz)     →  mission_manager · health_monitor

  swarm_coordinator →  /mc/swarm/peer_states (1 Hz)   →  formation_controller · mission_manager
  swarm_coordinator →  /mc/swarm/voronoi_cell (event) →  search_planner_node · mission_manager
  swarm_coordinator →  /mc/swarm/isr_role (event)     →  mission_manager_node

  mission_manager  →  /mc/mission_phase (on-change + 1 Hz)  →  swarm_coordinator · gcs_mavlink · health_monitor
  mission_manager  →  /mc/manager/heartbeat (≥1 Hz)        →  health_monitor_node (watchdog)

  search_planner    →  /mc/search/coverage_path (event)      →  mission_manager_node
  visual_localisation  →  /mc/local_pose (≥10 Hz)            →  perception_down_node · gcs_mavlink
  visual_localisation  →  /mc/localisation_mode (event)      →  gcs_mavlink · health_monitor
  perception_down_node (renamed from detection_node)  →  /mc/detections (event)  →  gcs_mavlink_node
  perception_front_node  →  /mc/perception/front/detections (event)  →  video_mux · gcs_mavlink
  perception_front_node  →  /mc/perception/front/tracks (≥5 Hz)      →  video_mux_node
  video_mux_node    →  /mc/video/downlink_status (≥1 Hz)      →  health_monitor
  health_monitor    →  /mc/health (≥1 Hz)                    →  gcs_mavlink · mission_manager
  health_monitor    →  /mc/fault (event)                     →  mission_manager_node
end note

